{
    "title": "Nicegram: Chat for Telegram X",
    "description": "\u200b\u200bThe all-in-one Telegram client elevating your conversations!\r\n\r\nNicegram is an alternative Telegram client, equipped with a set of innovative AI-driven features to advance your daily communication: \r\n\r\n\u2013 Unlimited Accounts: Sign in and switch between an unlimited number of accounts on a single device.\r\n\r\n\u2013 Nicegram Wallet: Your personal multi-chain, non-custodial Web3 wallet, now supporting TON and EVM, simplifies managing digital assets with comprehensive security features. Effortlessly send and receive tokens to and from your contacts in-chat, process crypto transactions with ease, and navigate through a broad spectrum of decentralized apps.\r\n\r\n\u2013 AI Assistance: With the Lily AI chatbot built-in and ready to answer any query, utilize AI shortcuts to instantly streamline messaging with summaries, translations, comments, and topic explanations, alongside image and avatar generation.\r\n\r\n\u2013 Upgrade your Telegram with Unique Features: Secret Chats, Double Bottom, channel content downloads, In-chat Translator, interface story hiding, circular video messaging directly from your gallery, and so much more introduced on Nicegram\u2019s official website at https://nicegram.app/features!\r\n\r\nDownload Nicegram now and experience messaging like never before!\r\n\r\nUnlock advanced capabilities with Nicegram Premium, featuring AI Assistance, Mention All, and a Built-in Translator, all available through subscription or simple in-app purchases.\r\n\r\nFor any assistance or feedback, our dedicated support team is just a click away. Contact us on Telegram at @nicegram_support_manager or via email at nicegram@appvillis.com. \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://nicegram.app/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://appvillis.com/eula.html\r\n\r\nWebsite: https://nicegram.app\r\n\r\nWiki: https://wiki.nicegram.app\r\n\r\nTelegram: https://t.me/nicegramapp\r\n\r\nGitHub: https://github.com/Nicegram",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u200b\u200bThe all-in-one Telegram client elevating your conversations!<br><br>Nicegram is an alternative Telegram client, equipped with a set of innovative AI-driven features to advance your daily communication: <br><br>\u2013 Unlimited Accounts: Sign in and switch between an unlimited number of accounts on a single device.<br><br>\u2013 Nicegram Wallet: Your personal multi-chain, non-custodial Web3 wallet, now supporting TON and EVM, simplifies managing digital assets with comprehensive security features. Effortlessly send and receive tokens to and from your contacts in-chat, process crypto transactions with ease, and navigate through a broad spectrum of decentralized apps.<br><br>\u2013 AI Assistance: With the Lily AI chatbot built-in and ready to answer any query, utilize AI shortcuts to instantly streamline messaging with summaries, translations, comments, and topic explanations, alongside image and avatar generation.<br><br>\u2013 Upgrade your Telegram with Unique Features: Secret Chats, Double Bottom, channel content downloads, In-chat Translator, interface story hiding, circular video messaging directly from your gallery, and so much more introduced on Nicegram\u2019s official website at https://nicegram.app/features!<br><br>Download Nicegram now and experience messaging like never before!<br><br>Unlock advanced capabilities with Nicegram Premium, featuring AI Assistance, Mention All, and a Built-in Translator, all available through subscription or simple in-app purchases.<br><br>For any assistance or feedback, our dedicated support team is just a click away. Contact us on Telegram at @nicegram_support_manager or via email at nicegram@appvillis.com. <br><br>Privacy Policy: https://nicegram.app/privacy-policy<br><br>Terms of Use: https://appvillis.com/eula.html<br><br>Website: https://nicegram.app<br><br>Wiki: https://wiki.nicegram.app<br><br>Telegram: https://t.me/nicegramapp<br><br>GitHub: https://github.com/Nicegram",
